   "statement": "The pickup place said it cannot promise now to notify Bahn when the release arrives and would have to check first.",
   "source": "pickup_place: Calverona Hamburg, Lukas Brandt (workshop)",
   "channel": "call",
   "at": "2026-10-21T09:28:13.309Z",
   "strength": "stated"
  },
  {
   "id": "cd-420458-cb-20261024-104722-ivw-f14",
   "statement": "The pickup place asked Bahn to contact them once the release has been sent, and said they will then check whether it has arrived.",
   "source": "pickup_place: Calverona Hamburg, Lukas Brandt (workshop)",
   "channel": "call",
   "at": "2026-10-21T09:28:13.309Z",
   "strength": "stated"
  },
  {
   "id": "cd-420458-cb-20261024-104722-ivw-f15",
   "statement": "The pickup place agreed that Bahn will contact them once the release has been sent and that they will check then.",
   "source": "pickup_place: Calverona Hamburg, Lukas Brandt (workshop)",
